Define factorial that takes n,
    If the value of n is less than or equal to 1,
        Return 1.
    End if.
    Call factorial with the value of n minus 1 and store the result in sub result.
    Return the value of n times sub result.
End define.

Ask for age with the message How old are you.
Call factorial with the value of age and store the result in result.
Say the value of result.
